Specter AI integrates with the following third-party, independently-licensed
open-source security tools and frameworks at runtime (they are NOT bundled or
redistributed with this project; install them separately under their own
licenses):

  - Nmap, Nuclei, httpx, ffuf, subfinder, naabu, katana, Nikto, sqlmap,
    testssl.sh, WPScan, Trivy
  - C2 frameworks referenced as optional integration targets: Sliver
    (open source), and the commercial products Cobalt Strike and Mythic.
    Their names are trademarks of their respective owners and are used here
    for interoperability/identification only.

No third-party source code is vendored into this repository.
